From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:33:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ppe: offload cross-tree RTL837x bridge forwarding

Authorize learned unicast between independent RTL837x trees of the same
MPPE under RTNL: recheck bridge, forwarding state, isolation and matching
customer VLAN membership. Select the exact ingress source VP and a
VLAN-only output next hop carrying the destination standalone SVID.

Open only referenced physical egress members of the source VSI; never
flood or learn a hardware FDB path there. Unsupported paths retain software
forwarding. Withdraw flows on carrier loss and existing policy changes.

Split from:
  0677-net-ppe-mppe-rtl837x-bridge-full.patch ([PATCH] net: ppe: offload cross-tree RTL837x bridge flows on MPPE)

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

